menu "khal: console ports"

    config KHAL_CONSOLE_DOCK
        bool "Console also on the magnetic dock (USB CDC on GPIO26/27)"
        depends on IDF_TARGET_ESP32P4
        help
            A second console on the magnetic pads, as USB CDC through the
            charging base. It takes the OTG controller, which an app may want
            for itself. kodeOS raises CONFIG_TINYUSB_CDC_RX_BUFSIZE and
            _TX_BUFSIZE to 4096 so a whole 4 KB install window fits, which
            costs about 7 KB of internal RAM.

            If unsure, say N.

    config KHAL_CONSOLE_DOCK_TX_WAIT_MS
        int "Longest a console write waits for the dock host to drain"
        depends on KHAL_CONSOLE_DOCK
        range 0 200
        default 20
        help
            How long a write waits for the dock's host to read before it drops
            the rest, so a port nobody reads never slows the console.

endmenu
